Implemented PARALLEL-1.

Summary:
- Threaded `conversation_id` from `CallContext` into `CompletionRequest.metadata`, then into outbound OpenAI-compatible provider headers as `X-Disco-Conversation`.
- MiniMax relay now reads that header and logs `conversation_id` on relay records, `None` when absent.
- Provider ledger parsing/oracle and sidecar `provider_calls_after_terminal` now scope records with a non-empty `conversation_id` to that conversation only; unscoped records still apply to all.
- Added relay, router/header, ledger scoping, and concurrent sidecar overlap regression tests.
- Did not touch `scenarios.yaml`; did not restart servers; did not commit.

